* ''A human carries many faces, and every vessel stands by capability'' (operator, 2026-11-12: //"a human carries multiple faces"//; //"isomorphic by intent for all vessels by capability"//; //"users have leaf-device fleets, operators have leaf+node fleets"//). A user's fleet holds leaves alone, so the fleet-join door, the founding door and the carried seat stand whole on a leaf; an operator's fleet adds nodes. One composer and one seat core serve every vessel, and a host differs only in what its capabilities carry (<<~ loulou uri=`lar:///ha.ka.ba/lares/docs/pono/device-capabilities-2026#/device-seats`>>, its in-house rulings 1 to 10; the stories in <<~ loulou uri=`lar:///ha.ka.ba/lararium/mesh/dreamnet-architecture#/the-walkers`>>).

